                <invention-title lang="de">SCHMIERUNG EINES ACHSLAGERS BEI EINER DREHUNG IM UND GEGEN DEN LINKEN DREHRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">LUBRIFICATION DE PALIER LISSE PENDANT UNE ROTATION EN SENS HORAIRE ET EN SENS HORAIRE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">LUBRICATION OF JOURNAL BEARING DURING CLOCKWISE AND COUNTER-CLOCKWISE ROTATION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a lubrication system for a gear-turbofan engine, the lubrication system comprising: an epicyclic gear-train including a journal bearing; and a bi-directional auxiliary pump operatively coupled to a fan of the gear-turbofan engine, the bi-directional auxiliary pump including a first pump port and a second pump port; wherein rotation of the fan below a predetermined operational speed range of the gear-turbofan engine in a first direction causes the bi-directional auxiliary pump to transfer lubricant outwardly from the first pump port to the journal bearing and wherein rotation of the fan below the predetermined operational speed range of the gear-turbofan engine in a second direction, which is opposite to the first direction, causes the bi-directional auxiliary pump to transfer lubricant outwardly from the second pump port to the journal bearing.</p>
            </abstract>
